Error [E1309]: `#[Flag]` on `verbose` has nothing to opt out of
  --> tests/ui/cli_flag_misuse.jet:3:7
    |
  3 |     #[Flag] verbose: Bool
    |       ^^^^
 Why: `#[Flag]` keeps a required value field flag-only. Bool fields, optional fields (`T?`), and fields with `#[Default(...)]` already stay flag-only.
 Fix: remove `#[Flag]`, or make the field a required scalar without `#[Default]`
